          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "zIndex": 1
        }
      ],
      "svg": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "id": "nebo_7",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "nebo_7_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "There the LORD showed him the whole land — Gilead as far as Dan, all of Naphtali, the territory of Ephraim and Manasseh, all the land of Judah as far as the Mediterranean Sea.",
          "position": "center",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "zIndex": 1
        }
      ],
      "svg": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "id": "nebo_8",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "nebo_8_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "The Negev, the whole region of the Jordan — the land from Jericho, the city of palms, all the way to Zoar.",
          "position": "center",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "zIndex": 1
        }
      ],
      "svg": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "id": "nebo_9",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "nebo_9_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Then Moses, the servant of the LORD, died there in Moab, as the LORD had said. He buried him in the valley, in Moab — and no one knows where his grave is to this day.",
          "position": "center",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
